3️⃣ CONTAINS DUPLICATE ⭐⭐

Problem

Check whether an array contains duplicate values.

Example:

[1, 2, 3, 1]

Answer:

True


---

✅ Optimal Python

def containsDuplicate(nums):
    return len(nums) != len(set(nums))

Complexity

\[
O(n)
\]

🧠 Pattern

> Duplicate checking → Set




