4️⃣ VALID ANAGRAM ⭐⭐⭐

Two strings are anagrams if they contain the same characters with the same frequency.

Example:

listen
silent

✅ Anagram.


---

Approach

Use a frequency map.

Python Solution

from collections import Counter

def isAnagram(s, t):
    return Counter(s) == Counter(t)

Complexity

\[
O(n)
\]

🧠 Pattern

> Character frequency → HashMap / Counter




